/\\ grant' = m\n  /\\ UNCHANGED dispensed\n\nDispense(m) ==\n  /\\ grant = m\n  /\\ dispensed[m] = 0\n  /\\ dispensed' = [dispensed EXCEPT ![m] = dispensed[m] + 1]\n  /\\ grant' = \"ring\"\n\nNext == \\E m \\in Machines : PassToRing(m) \\/ Deliver(m) \\/ Dispense(m)\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nDispensedAtMostOnce == \\A m \\in Machines : dispensed[m] <= 1\n====", "module_sha256": "9f436f4463f97528db6c948e1d0befd03bd20d18cdb14065d53af6d40827872c", "process": {"cleanup_complete": true, "command": ["/lus/grand/projects/EVITA/eric-spencer/tools/jre21/bin/java", "-Djava.io.tmpdir=/home/eric-spencer/tla-fullmodule-structural-curriculum-20260915-v3/result.7624329/sany_reference/46/jtmp", "-DTLA-Library=/lus/grand/projects/EVITA/eric-spencer/prove-tla-fullmodule-train-probe-eval-20260906-v1/tools/tlapm/lib/tlapm/stdlib:/lus/grand/projects/EVITA/eric-spencer/prove-tla-fullmodule-train-probe-eval-20260906-v1/tools/community-modules:/lus/grand/projects/EVITA/eric-spencer/prove-tla-fullmodule-train-probe-eval-20260906-v1/tools/extra-modules", "-cp", "/lus/grand/projects/EVITA/eric-spencer/prove-tla-fullmodule-train-probe-eval-20260906-v1/tools/tla2tools.jar", "tla2sany.SANY", "W4Od13m1p5t1.tla"], "containment": "Best-effort ancestry polling; instantaneous unobserved reparenting is not excluded", "cwd": "/home/eric-spencer/tla-fullmodule-structural-curriculum-20260915-v3/result.7624329/sany_reference/46", "errors": [], "execution_complete": true, "output": "\n****** SANY2 Version 2.1 created 24 February 2014\n\nParsing file /home/eric-spencer/tla-fullmodule-structural-curriculum-20260915-v3/result.7624329/sany_reference/46/W4Od13m1p5t1.tla\nParsing file /home/eric-spencer/tla-fullmodule-structural-curriculum-20260915-v3/result.7624329/sany_reference/46/jtmp/Naturals.tla\nSemantic processing of module Naturals\nSemantic processing of module W4Od13m1p5t1\n", "output_complete": true, "output_limit": false, "owned_processes": [{"created": 1789495176.08, "pgid": 302997, "pid":